-- The governance instance (P11, N7, O7): one mutual block (C5). GPolicy is
-- the policy, a list of layers. GLayer is a constant layer, a seal or a
-- nested governance context. Gov is the governance context: its public
-- part is a GPolicy and its private part is a Nat. The policy in a context
-- is a strict part of that context. The indexed form `Gov (p : GPolicy)`
-- refuses with DOMAIN_QIIT (K1 limit), so the instance is a mutual block
-- and not an inductive-inductive definition.
family GPolicy := gpNil | gpCons (gpHead : GLayer) (gpTail : GPolicy)
