def gField : (v : Visibility) -> Type 0 :=
  fun (v : Visibility) => fold GPolicy Nat v
-- eval is one block fold with the motives Nat -> Nat (GPolicy), Nat -> Nat
-- (GLayer) and Nat (Gov). gpNil keeps the running value. gpCons runs the
-- head, then the tail. gConst adds a constant (saturating, as Ref). gSeal
-- sets the value to 0. gNest adds the decision of the nested context. gov
-- applies the folded policy to the private part. The fold descends through
-- gNest and gov, so the recursion is on the nesting of the context (O7).
