-- private value available as the witness for EvalCompose, even when the
-- public policy contains a seal.
def gEval : GPolicy -> Ctx gField -> Nat :=
  fun (p : GPolicy) => fun (c : Ctx gField) => govDec (gov (pub gField c) (gRun p (priv gField c)))
-- The signature. The proof is a Nat (the private part). compose is append:
-- a block fold with a GPolicy -> GPolicy motive for the policy sort.
-- Only the outer tail takes the second policy. A nested gov rebuilds its
